            "post": {
                "operationId": "postActivities",
                "tags": [
                    "Lessons"
                ],
                "summary": "Create a lesson",
                "description": "**Why you'll use it**\n\nAdd a one-off session — a trial class, a workshop, a catch-up slot — without opening SchoolTracs.\n\n**Before you send**\n\nA lesson always belongs to a course, so `courseId` is required and must name a course in a centre your key covers. Send `date` as `YYYY-MM-DD` and `startTime` / `endTime` as `HH:mm` or `HH:mm:ss`, without a timezone offset. The latest permitted `endTime` on creation is `32:00` or `32:00:00` (8:00 am on the day after `date`). If you leave `endDate` out it is set to `date`, which is what you want for a single session. Creating a lesson does not book anybody into it — use `POST /v1/enrollments` for that.\n\n**Plan**\n\nPAID plan only — a FREE key has no write scope for this resource, so the request is rejected with `403 This API is not included in the current subscription plan.` before it reaches the controller.",
                "parameters": [],
                "responses": {
                    "201": {
                        "description": "The requested record.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Activity"
                                        },
                                        "meta": {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "data",
                                        "meta"
                                    ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
                    },
                    "422": {
