        "/activities/{id}": {
            "get": {
                "operationId": "getActivitiesId",
                "tags": [
                    "Lessons"
                ],
                "summary": "Get one lesson",
                "description": "**Why you'll use it**\n\nEverything about a single session: who is booked, who turned up, which room and which teacher.\n\nThe date window that applies to the list endpoint does not apply here — if you know the ID and it belongs to your centre, you get the lesson.\n\n**Example queries**\n\n- `/88201?include=staffs,facilities,center`  \n  The full picture of one session.\n\n**Related records you can pull in** (`?include=`)\n\n- `center` — The centre the lesson belongs to, as `{id, name}`.\n- `customers` — Every student booked into the lesson, with their attendance, payment and make-up state. A booking's `status` is one of `W` weekly, `B` fortnightly, `T` single, `M` make-up, `S` skipped, `J` just-skipped, `N` normal, `Q` quit, `D` quit and moved up, `I` temporarily quit. _(already included by default — asking again changes nothing.)_\n- `staffs` — The teachers assigned to the lesson.\n- `facilities` — The rooms or resources booked for it.",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "id",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "description": "Identifier of the record to act on. A record outside the centres your key covers reports `404`, never `403`.",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "fields[activity]",
                        "in": "query",
                        "description": "Return only these fields, comma separated. `id` is always included whether you ask for it or not. The key is the model's table name, so it is `fields[activity]` for this resource.",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "example": "centerId,nextId,category"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "include",
                        "in": "query",
                        "description": "Related records to embed in the response, comma separated.",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "example": "center,customers"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "withTrashed",
                        "in": "query",
                        "description": "Include soft-deleted records alongside live ones. PAID plan only — a FREE key is silently given the normal, non-deleted result set instead.",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "boolean"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "onlyTrashed",
                        "in": "query",
                        "description": "Return only soft-deleted records. PAID plan only — a FREE key is silently given the normal, non-deleted result set instead.",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "boolean"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "The requested record.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Activity"
                                        },
                                        "meta": {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "data",
                                        "meta"
                                    ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationFailed"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    },
                    "500": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
                    }
                }
            },
            "patch": {
                "operationId": "patchActivitiesId",
                "tags": [
                    "Lessons"
                ],
                "summary": "Update a lesson",
                "description": "**Why you'll use it**\n\nMove a session, rename it, change the room note, or adjust its capacity.\n\n**Before you send**\n\nSend only the keys you want to change. Use `YYYY-MM-DD` for dates and `HH:mm` or `HH:mm:ss` for `startTime` / `endTime`, without a timezone offset. Two things behave specially:\n\n- **`applyTo`** decides how far a change reaches through a repeating series: `ThisOnly` (the default) touches just this lesson, `Following` carries the change through the rest of the series.\n- **`date` is applied as a shift, not a set.** The API works out how many days you moved the lesson and applies that offset, which is what makes `applyTo: \"Following\"` move a whole series coherently.\n\n**Plan**\n\nPAID plan only — a FREE key has no write scope for this resource, so the request is rejected with `403 This API is not included in the current subscription plan.` before it reaches the controller.\n\n`PUT` is accepted as an equivalent alias for `PATCH` on this path.\n\nAn update never moves a record between centres: `centerId` is dropped before anything is written. You may still send it, but it has to match the centre the record is already in — a different one is rejected with `403`.",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "id",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "description": "Identifier of the record to act on. A record outside the centres your key covers reports `404`, never `403`.",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "The requested record.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Activity"
                                        },
                                        "meta": {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "data",
                                        "meta"
                                    ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationFailed"
                    },
                    "429": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
                    },
                    "500": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
                    }
                },
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": false,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "properties": {
                                    "centerId": {
                                        "type": "integer",
                                        "minimum": 1,
                                        "description": "Defaults to the centre bound to the API key. A supplied value must match the bound centre. Optional — omit it to leave the stored value alone."
                                    },
                                    "nextId": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "integer",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "category": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "string",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "name": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Optional — omit it to leave the stored value alone."
                                    },
                                    "level": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "string",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "date": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "date",
                                        "description": "Optional — omit it to leave the stored value alone."
                                    },
                                    "startDate": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "string",
                                            "null"
                                        ],
                                        "format": "date"
                                    },
                                    "endDate": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "string",
                                            "null"
                                        ],
                                        "format": "date"
                                    },
                                    "startTime": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "string",
                                            "null"
                                        ],
                                        "description": "Optional — omit it to leave the stored value alone."
                                    },
                                    "endTime": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "string",
                                            "null"
                                        ],
                                        "description": "Optional — omit it to leave the stored value alone."
                                    },
                                    "color": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "string",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "classId": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "integer",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "number": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "number",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "quota": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "number",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "enrolled": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "number",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "detail": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "string",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "remark": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "string",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "moreInfo": {
                                        "type": [
                                            "string",
                                            "null"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "courseId": {
                                        "type": "integer",
                                        "description": "Optional — omit it to leave the stored value alone."
                                    },
                                    "applyTo": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "enum": [
                                            "ThisOnly",
                                            "Following"
                                        ],
                                        "description": "Optional — omit it to leave the stored value alone."
                                    }
                                },
                                "additionalProperties": true,
                                "description": "Keys outside this list are dropped before validation rather than rejected. `id`, `created`, `updated`, `deleted` and `deletedAt` are never writable."
                            },
                            "example": {
                                "startTime": "17:00",
                                "endTime": "18:00",
