        "/centers": {
            "get": {
                "operationId": "getCenters",
                "tags": [
                    "Centres"
                ],
                "summary": "List centres",
                "description": "**Why you'll use it**\n\nThe cheapest call that proves your key works, and the one that tells you which `centerId` values every other endpoint will accept. Worth calling once at start-up and caching.\n\n**Before you send**\n\nYou will only ever see the centres your key was bound to, so this list is usually very short. The internal \"all centres\" pseudo-record is never returned.\n\n**Example queries**\n\n- `?fields[center]=id,name`  \n  Just the IDs and names, for a dropdown.",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "page",
                        "in": "query",
                        "description": "Page number, starting at 1. How deep you may page is capped by your plan — 5 pages on FREE and 200 on PAID, independent of page size. Going past the cap is a `422`, not an empty page.",
