                "summary": "List fees",
                "description": "**Why you'll use it**\n\nShow prices on your website, or find the `feeId` that `POST /v1/enrollments` needs.\n\n**Example queries**\n\n- `?filter[courseId]=3120`  \n  Every way one course can be bought.\n- `?filter[showOnStore]=1&filter[saleTo][exists]=false`  \n  Publicly sellable fees with no end date.\n- `?filter[price][lte]=2000&sort=price`  \n  Everything under a price point, cheapest first.",
