                        "description": "Computed as `total` − `paid`. You can filter on it directly to find what is outstanding. Exact match against the computed value. A comma-separated list becomes an `IN (...)` match. Operators: `gt`, `gte`, `lt`, `lte`, `eq`, `ne`, `neq`, `in`, `nin`, `exists` — e.g. `filter[dueAmount][gte]=…`, or the JSON form `filter[dueAmount]={\"gte\":\"…\"}`.",
