                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "filter[postedDate]",
                        "in": "query",
                        "description": "When the note was first written. It is preserved across edits. Matches that calendar date. A comma-separated list matches any of the dates. Operators: `gt`, `gte`, `lt`, `lte`, `eq`, `ne`, `neq`, `in`, `nin`, `exists` — e.g. `filter[postedDate][gte]=…`, or the JSON form `filter[postedDate]={\"gte\":\"…\"}`.",
