                        "in": "query",
                        "description": "Identity-document number, where your centre records one. Exact match. A comma-separated list becomes an `IN (...)` match, and an explicit `null` matches rows where the field is unset. Operators: `eq`, `neq`, `ne`, `in`, `nin`, `exists` — e.g. `filter[citizenId][eq]=…`, or the JSON form `filter[citizenId]={\"eq\":\"…\"}`.",
