            "post": {
                "operationId": "postLeads",
                "tags": [
                    "Leads"
                ],
                "summary": "Create or update a lead",
                "description": "**Why you'll use it**\n\nWire a \"request a trial\" or \"get a prospectus\" form on your website straight into SchoolTracs, so the follow-up happens where staff already work instead of in an inbox.\n\n**Before you send**\n\nThis one endpoint does both jobs. Leave `id` out and it creates a lead; send an `id` and it updates that one instead. Either way you get `200` back — never `201`.\n\nOn a create, `name` is required. `centerId` defaults to the centre bound to your API key. On an update, `centerId` is optional. If you send it, it has to match the centre the lead is already in — you cannot move a lead between centres, and trying returns `403`.\n\nA lead is not a student. Nothing is enrolled, billed or scheduled here — but see the note below about `status`, which can change that.\n\n**Plan**\n\nAvailable on every plan. This is one of the few resources a FREE key can write to.\n\nTwo side effects are worth knowing about before you write to `status`:\n\n- **Setting `status` to `W` (won) converts the lead into a student.** A customer record is created from the lead's details there and then, and the lead is linked to it. This is not reversible through the API, so don't use `W` as a general \"closed\" marker.\n- **Adding a `comment` to a lead still sitting at `N` (new) moves it to `P` (prospecting)** automatically, on the assumption that someone has now actually followed it up.\n\nValid `status` values are `N` new, `P` prospecting, `Q` on waitlist, `W` won, and `L` lost.",
                "parameters": [],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "The requested record.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Lead"
                                        },
                                        "meta": {
                                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "required": [
                                        "data",
                                        "meta"
                                    ]
                                },
                                "example": {
                                    "data": {
                                        "id": 14022,
                                        "name": "Rory Fenwick",
                                        "fullName": null,
                                        "localName": null,
                                        "firstName": null,
                                        "lastName": null,
                                        "gender": null,
                                        "email": "rory.fenwick@example.com",
                                        "phone": null,
                                        "mobile": "91234567",
                                        "contact1Name": "Dana Fenwick",
                                        "contact1Phone": "96543210",
                                        "contact1Email": null,
                                        "contact2Name": null,
                                        "contact2Phone": null,
                                        "contact2Email": null,
                                        "address": null,
                                        "district": null,
                                        "dobYear": null,
                                        "dobMonth": null,
                                        "dobDay": null,
                                        "education": null,
                                        "level": null,
                                        "occupation": null,
                                        "marketingSource": "Website form",
                                        "comment": "Interested in Saturday morning piano for a 9-year-old.",
                                        "centerId": 41,
                                        "citizenId": null,
                                        "created": "2026-03-18T01:04:22+00:00",
                                        "updated": "2026-03-18T01:04:22+00:00",
                                        "deleted": false
                                    },
                                    "meta": {
                                        "message": "OK",
                                        "apiVersion": "v1",
                                        "timestamp": "2026-03-18T01:04:22+00:00"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
