                "summary": "Update a product",
                "description": "**Why you'll use it**\n\nAdjust a price, correct a stock count, or hide an item from the store.\n\n**Before you send**\n\nWriting `quantity` sets the stock level outright rather than adjusting it by that amount. Read the current value first if you mean to add or subtract.\n\n**Plan**\n\nPAID plan only — a FREE key has no write scope for this resource, so the request is rejected with `403 This API is not included in the current subscription plan.` before it reaches the controller.\n\n`PUT` is accepted as an equivalent alias for `PATCH` on this path.\n\nAn update never moves a record between centres: `centerId` is dropped before anything is written. You may still send it, but it has to match the centre the record is already in — a different one is rejected with `403`.",
                "parameters": [
