            "post": {
                "operationId": "postStaffs",
                "tags": [
                    "Staff"
                ],
                "summary": "Create a staff member",
                "description": "**Why you'll use it**\n\nAdd a teacher from your own HR onboarding, ready to be assigned to lessons.\n\n**Before you send**\n\nCreating a staff record does **not** give anyone access to SchoolTracs. `loginEnabled`, the sign-in identifier and invitations are all managed in the app and cannot be set here. Leave `number` out and one is generated.\n\n**Plan**\n\nPAID plan only — a FREE key has no write scope for this resource, so the request is rejected with `403 This API is not included in the current subscription plan.` before it reaches the controller.",
                "parameters": [],
                "responses": {
